<title>USA: MELAMINE SELLS TECHNOLOGY TO DSM.</title>
<headline>MELAMINE SELLS TECHNOLOGY TO DSM.</headline>
<dateline>DONALDSONVILLE, La. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Melamine Chemicals Inc Wednesday said it will sell its patented high-pressure production technologies to DSM Melamine BV, a unit of DSM NV, for $25 million.</p>
<p>The Netherlands-based DSM will acquire the global rights to MCI's M-II and M-IV patents and related expertise.</p>
<p>Melamine will retain the right to use this technology to build two additional plants in the Americas, Melamine said.</p>
</text>
